{"agent":"main","body":{"args_hash":"sha256:744b67f683aca4ddcfab74db72ec50f31a52b0b34af83262aeaf766f33b8da56","args_inline":{"content":"---\nname: selectfordeletion-contract\ndescription: Hard constraints on snapkeep's selectForDeletion — pinned legal holds, fixed positional signature, newest-first output\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\n`selectForDeletion` in `src/prune.ts` is bound by contracts that live outside this repo:\n\n- Snapshots tagged `pinned` are legal holds and must never appear in the returned list, regardless of policy or age. The legal hold list went live 2026-09-14. All other tags (`replicated`, `verified`, …) are free-form and carry no retention meaning.\n- The signature is fixed: the scheduler and two other services call it positionally.\n- Deletion is irreversible — the scheduler deletes every id returned, and it diffs the returned ids against the previous run to alert on surprises, so output stays newest-first and ids stay strings.\n\n**Why:** These are invariants enforced by callers and by legal, not by anything visible in this repo; a \"harmless\" refactor of the signature or ordering breaks the scheduler silently.\n\n**How to apply:** Treat any change to prune.ts as additive within these constraints. See [[retention-week-counting]].\n","file_path":"/var/folders/yb/b_617z_s2ml933nmr_k7m47m0000gn/T/saga-bench-3578220652/ts-0011-backup-prune-amnesia/1/cfg/claude-config/projects/-private-var-folders-yb-b-617z-s2ml933nmr-k7m47m0000gn-T-saga-bench-3578220652-ts-0011-backup-prune-amnesia-1-ws/memory/selectfordeletion-contract.md"},"component":"harness","cwd_rel":".","index_version":null,"tool":"Write","tool_use_id":"toolu_01LiTgQX3b1FyiLb51mDcNaF"},"hash":"sha256:6e6b996d1270dd0738b9421c731df6eceda311298e99055a5fbc6eac7f698f61","mono_ns":23000000,"prev":"sha256:ad5ea7ff244f2c37f7eb7e33fc4ce5e77d84158bdfdeb6b9da1154bd5c4e0519","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":23,"session":"fa7984d1-1211-4ab8-8b2b-d47534a277cc","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.023Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_call"}
